Browser tool and desktop package

Tool descriptions, JSON schemas, approval classification and display labels are
adapted from Sailry c4bb60a2:
plugins/builtin/browser/agent.rs
plugins/builtin/browser/desktop/messages.rs
locales/en.yml and locales/zh-CN.yml

Browser chrome and profile settings preserve the composition and interactions in:
plugins/builtin/browser/desktop/workspace/view.rs
plugins/builtin/browser/desktop/workspace/mod.rs
plugins/builtin/browser/desktop.rs
plugins/builtin/browser/desktop/actions.rs

Native WebViews, controller routing, browser profiles, Keychain access and
confined artifacts remain in Sailry's Rust core. The package composes Kit
controls and calls those public capabilities.
